# Commands run by the launchd job com.redwood.demo (see com.redwood.demo.plist).
# The widget page (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.widget, gpu=1): wait for SpringBoard, then one rightward swipe
# that starts inside the home screen (not on the edge, where the system gesture takes it) to reach
# Today View. Nothing else follows, so the page is left as it landed for the screenshots.
/redwood/bin/sound_test springboard
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 30 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.95 0.5 400 wait 20
